  "description": "Works with GitHub: issues, pull requests, CI runs, reviews, releases and search, through gh or, for public repositories, the GitHub REST API. Use for anything on github.com, such as why CI failed or what a pull request changes.",
  "author": {
    "name": "Cluaiz",
